# Motion & animation

**When:** adding transitions, loaders, enter/exit, or press/hover motion under `web/`.

Prefer existing tokens in `app-design-tokens-foundation.css` (`--ease-*`, `--duration-*`). Values below are **fallback when no token exists**.

Motion communicates state — never decoration. Also honor a11y rules in `frontend/accessibility.mdc`.

---

## Tokens (preferred)

Use from foundation when present:

- Easing: `--ease-default`, `--ease-out`, `--ease-in`, `--ease-in-out`, `--ease-ui`, `--ease-linear`, `--ease-bounce` (sparingly)
- Duration: `--duration-instant` … `--duration-slower`, plus `--duration-toast`, `--duration-skeleton`, `--duration-ui-phase`, `--duration-spinner`

### Fallback timing (when no token exists)

```css
--ease-default: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
--ease-out:     cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1);
--ease-in:      cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1);
--duration-fast:   100ms;
--duration-normal: 150ms;
--duration-moderate: 250ms;
--duration-slow:   350ms;
```

---

## Motion rules

- Hover color/border: ~`150ms` / `--duration-normal`
- Press scale: `transform: scale(0.97–0.98)` over ~`100ms`
- Dropdowns: fade + translate `8px → 0` over ~`200ms` ease-out
- Modals: backdrop fade ~`200ms`; content scale `0.96 → 1` + fade ~`250ms`
- Toasts: slide in ~`300ms` / `--duration-toast`
- Page transitions: max ~`400ms`; prefer fade or subtle slide
- Skeletons: `--duration-skeleton` (~`1.5s`) pulse, ease-in-out, infinite
- **Always** add `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` — disable or minimize animations
- **Never animate `width` / `height` / `top` / `left` / `right` / `bottom` directly** — use `transform`, `opacity`, or careful `max-height` with overflow hidden

### Animate these

`opacity`, `transform`, `box-shadow`, `background-color`, `border-color`.

### Not these

`top`, `left`, `width`, `height` (layout-thrashing properties).

---

## Do not

- Animate layout properties when transform/opacity suffice
- Skip reduced-motion handling
- Use bounce easing for critical productivity chrome
